  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components thoroughly, bring to a boil and cool down under a N2-CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture. Distribute the medium into culture vessels (e.g., 10 ml in Balch tubes) under the same gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave. After cooling, aseptically and anaerobically add per liter the following solutions (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized and stored under a N2 gas atmosphere; **filter-sterilized and stored under an 80% N2-20% CO2 gas mixture):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "Filter-sterilize. Use always freshly prepared solution prior to inoculation."
    }
  ]
}